{
  "id": "tutorial-06-interactive-html-apps",
  "title": "06 Interactive HTML Mini-Apps",
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "c-t06-md01",
      "kind": "md",
      "source": "# 06 Interactive HTML Mini-Apps\n\nEach **HTML cell** is a sandboxed iframe with full JavaScript and CSS support.\n\nThat means every cell can be a self-contained mini application — no build tools, no imports, just HTML + CSS + JS in one cell.\n\nScroll down to see three complete mini-apps."
    },
    {
      "id": "c-t06-md02",
      "kind": "md",
      "source": "## 1. Color Palette Generator\n\nEnter a hex color and get a generated palette of complementary, analogous, and triadic colors with click-to-copy."
    },
    {
      "id": "c-t06-html01",
      "kind": "html",
      "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head><style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }\n  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; padding: 20px; background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; }\n  h3 { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 16px; }\n  .input-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; align-items: center; }\n  input[type=text] { background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; color: #f1f5f9; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; width: 120px; }\n  .preview { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid #334155; }\n  button { background: #3b82f6; color: white; border: none; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; }\n  button:hover { background: #2563eb; }\n  .palettes { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }\n  .palette-label { font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .swatches { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .swatch { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; padding-bottom: 6px; font-size: 10px; color: white; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); transition: transform 0.15s; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }\n  .swatch:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }\n  .toast { position: fixed; bottom: 16px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: #10b981; color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s; }\n  .toast.show { opacity: 1; }\n</style></head><body>\n  <h3>Color Palette Generator</h3>\n  <div class=\"input-row\">\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"hexInput\" value=\"#3b82f6\" placeholder=\"#hex\">\n    <div class=\"preview\" id=\"preview\"></div>\n    <button onclick=\"generate()\">Generate</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"palettes\" id=\"palettes\"></div>\n  <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\">Copied!</div>\n<script>\n  function hexToHsl(hex) {\n    let r = parseInt(hex.slice(1,3),16)/255, g = parseInt(hex.slice(3,5),16)/255, b = parseInt(hex.slice(5,7),16)/255;\n    let max = Math.max(r,g,b), min = Math.min(r,g,b), h, s, l = (max+min)/2;\n    if (max===min) { h=s=0; } else {\n      let d = max-min; s = l>0.5 ? d/(2-max-min) : d/(max+min);\n      switch(max) { case r: h=((g-b)/d+(g<b?6:0))/6; break; case g: h=((b-r)/d+2)/6; break; case b: h=((r-g)/d+4)/6; break; }\n    }\n    return [Math.round(h*360), Math.round(s*100), Math.round(l*100)];\n  }\n  function hslToHex(h,s,l) {\n    h=((h%360)+360)%360; s/=100; l/=100;\n    let a=s*Math.min(l,1-l), f=n=>{let k=(n+h/30)%12; return Math.round(255*(l-a*Math.max(Math.min(k-3,9-k,1),-1)));};\n    return '#'+[f(0),f(8),f(4)].map(x=>x.toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('');\n  }\n  function makePalette(name, offsets, h, s, l) {\n    return { name, colors: offsets.map(o => hslToHex(h+o, s, l)) };\n  }\n  function generate() {\n    const hex = document.getElementById('hexInput').value.trim();\n    if (!/^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$/.test(hex)) return;\n    document.getElementById('preview').style.background = hex;\n    const [h,s,l] = hexToHsl(hex);\n    const palettes = [\n      makePalette('Complementary', [0, 180], h, s, l),\n      makePalette('Analogous', [-30, -15, 0, 15, 30], h, s, l),\n      makePalette('Triadic', [0, 120, 240], h, s, l),\n      makePalette('Split-Complementary', [0, 150, 210], h, s, l),\n      { name: 'Shades', colors: [20,35,50,65,80].map(li => hslToHex(h, s, li)) },\n    ];\n    const container = document.getElementById('palettes');\n    container.innerHTML = palettes.map(p =>\n      `<div><div class=\"palette-label\">${p.name}</div><div class=\"swatches\">${p.colors.map(c =>\n        `<div class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:${c}\" onclick=\"copy('${c}')\">${c}</div>`\n      ).join('')}</div></div>`\n    ).join('');\n  }\n  function copy(text) {\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);\n    const t = document.getElementById('toast'); t.textContent = 'Copied ' + text; t.classList.add('show');\n    setTimeout(() => t.classList.remove('show'), 1200);\n  }\n  generate();\n</script>\n</body></html>"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-t06-md03",
      "kind": "md",
      "source": "## 2. Pomodoro Timer\n\nA working countdown timer with SVG ring progress, start/pause/reset controls, and an audio beep when complete."
    },
    {
      "id": "c-t06-html02",
      "kind": "html",
      "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head><style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }\n  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 300px; background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; gap: 16px; padding: 20px; }\n  .timer-ring { position: relative; width: 180px; height: 180px; }\n  svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }\n  circle { fill: none; stroke-width: 8; }\n  .bg { stroke: #1e293b; }\n  .progress { stroke: #3b82f6; stroke-linecap: round; transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.5s linear, stroke 0.3s; }\n  .time-display { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .controls { display: flex; gap: 10px; }\n  button { padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 10px; border: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }\n  .btn-start { background: #10b981; color: white; }\n  .btn-start:hover { background: #059669; }\n  .btn-pause { background: #f59e0b; color: white; }\n  .btn-pause:hover { background: #d97706; }\n  .btn-reset { background: #334155; color: #e2e8f0; }\n  .btn-reset:hover { background: #475569; }\n  .presets { display: flex; gap: 8px; }\n  .presets button { background: #1e293b; color: #94a3b8; padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155; }\n  .presets button:hover { border-color: #3b82f6; color: #3b82f6; }\n  .presets button.active { background: #3b82f6; color: white; border-color: #3b82f6; }\n  .done .progress { stroke: #10b981; }\n  .done .time-display { color: #10b981; }\n</style></head><body>\n  <div class=\"presets\">\n    <button onclick=\"setDuration(25*60)\" class=\"active\">25 min</button>\n    <button onclick=\"setDuration(15*60)\">15 min</button>\n    <button onclick=\"setDuration(5*60)\">5 min</button>\n    <button onclick=\"setDuration(60)\">1 min</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"timer-ring\" id=\"ring\">\n    <svg width=\"180\" height=\"180\">\n      <circle class=\"bg\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"82\"></circle>\n      <circle class=\"progress\" id=\"prog\" cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"82\" stroke-dasharray=\"515.22\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\"></circle>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"time-display\" id=\"display\">25:00</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <button class=\"btn-start\" id=\"startBtn\" onclick=\"toggle()\">Start</button>\n    <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"reset()\">Reset</button>\n  </div>\n<script>\n  const C = 2 * Math.PI * 82;\n  let total = 25*60, remaining = total, running = false, interval = null;\n  const prog = document.getElementById('prog');\n  const display = document.getElementById('display');\n  const startBtn = document.getElementById('startBtn');\n  const ring = document.getElementById('ring');\n  function fmt(s) { return String(Math.floor(s/60)).padStart(2,'0') + ':' + String(s%60).padStart(2,'0'); }\n  function render() {\n    display.textContent = fmt(remaining);\n    const pct = 1 - remaining / total;\n    prog.style.strokeDashoffset = C * (1 - pct);\n    ring.classList.toggle('done', remaining === 0);\n  }\n  function beep() {\n    try {\n      const ctx = new AudioContext(); const o = ctx.createOscillator(); const g = ctx.createGain();\n      o.connect(g); g.connect(ctx.destination); o.frequency.value = 880; g.gain.value = 0.3;\n      o.start(); o.stop(ctx.currentTime + 0.2);\n      setTimeout(() => { const o2 = ctx.createOscillator(); const g2 = ctx.createGain(); o2.connect(g2); g2.connect(ctx.destination); o2.frequency.value = 1100; g2.gain.value = 0.3; o2.start(); o2.stop(ctx.currentTime + 0.3); }, 300);\n    } catch(e) {}\n  }\n  function tick() {\n    if (remaining <= 0) { stop(); beep(); return; }\n    remaining--; render();\n  }\n  function toggle() {\n    if (running) stop(); else start();\n  }\n  function start() { if (remaining <= 0) return; running = true; interval = setInterval(tick, 1000); startBtn.textContent = 'Pause'; startBtn.className = 'btn-pause'; }\n  function stop() { running = false; clearInterval(interval); startBtn.textContent = 'Start'; startBtn.className = 'btn-start'; }\n  function reset() { stop(); remaining = total; render(); }\n  function setDuration(d) { stop(); total = d; remaining = d; render(); document.querySelectorAll('.presets button').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active')); event.target.classList.add('active'); }\n  render();\n</script>\n</body></html>"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-t06-md04",
      "kind": "md",
      "source": "## 3. Pixel Art Editor\n\nA 16×16 pixel canvas with color picker, click-to-paint, and an export button that downloads a PNG."
    },
    {
      "id": "c-t06-html03",
      "kind": "html",
      "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head><style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }\n  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; padding: 16px; background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n  h3 { font-size: 15px; }\n  .toolbar { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }\n  input[type=color] { width: 36px; height: 36px; border: 2px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; background: none; padding: 2px; }\n  button { padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; border: none; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }\n  .btn-clear { background: #334155; color: #e2e8f0; }\n  .btn-export { background: #8b5cf6; color: white; }\n  .btn-eraser { background: #475569; color: white; }\n  .btn-eraser.active { background: #ef4444; }\n  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(16, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: #1e293b; border: 2px solid #334155; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; width: min(400px, 90vw); height: min(400px, 90vw); }\n  .pixel { background: #0f172a; cursor: crosshair; transition: background 0.05s; }\n  .pixel:hover { opacity: 0.8; }\n</style></head><body>\n  <h3>Pixel Art Editor</h3>\n  <div class=\"toolbar\">\n    <input type=\"color\" id=\"color\" value=\"#3b82f6\">\n    <button class=\"btn-eraser\" id=\"eraserBtn\" onclick=\"toggleEraser()\">Eraser</button>\n    <button class=\"btn-clear\" onclick=\"clearGrid()\">Clear</button>\n    <button class=\"btn-export\" onclick=\"exportPng()\">Export PNG</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\"></div>\n<script>\n  const SIZE = 16;\n  const grid = document.getElementById('grid');\n  const cells = [];\n  let painting = false;\n  let eraser = false;\n  function toggleEraser() { eraser = !eraser; document.getElementById('eraserBtn').classList.toggle('active', eraser); }\n  function paint(cell) {\n    cell.style.background = eraser ? '#0f172a' : document.getElementById('color').value;\n    cell.dataset.color = eraser ? '' : document.getElementById('color').value;\n  }\n  for (let i = 0; i < SIZE * SIZE; i++) {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'pixel';\n    cell.dataset.color = '';\n    cell.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); painting = true; paint(cell); });\n    cell.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { if (painting) paint(cell); });\n    cell.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); paint(cell); }, {passive:false});\n    cell.addEventListener('touchmove', (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const t = e.touches[0];\n      const el = document.elementFromPoint(t.clientX, t.clientY);\n      if (el && el.classList.contains('pixel')) paint(el);\n    }, {passive:false});\n    grid.appendChild(cell);\n    cells.push(cell);\n  }\n  document.addEventListener('mouseup', () => painting = false);\n  function clearGrid() { cells.forEach(c => { c.style.background = '#0f172a'; c.dataset.color = ''; }); }\n  function exportPng() {\n    const scale = 16;\n    const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');\n    canvas.width = SIZE * scale; canvas.height = SIZE * scale;\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n    cells.forEach((c, i) => {\n      ctx.fillStyle = c.dataset.color || '#0f172a';\n      ctx.fillRect((i % SIZE) * scale, Math.floor(i / SIZE) * scale, scale, scale);\n    });\n    const a = document.createElement('a');\n    a.href = canvas.toDataURL('image/png');\n    a.download = 'pixel-art.png';\n    a.click();\n  }\n</script>\n</body></html>"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-t06-md05",
      "kind": "md",
      "source": "## What you learned\n\n- **HTML cells** are fully sandboxed iframes — each one is a complete web page\n- Inline `<style>` and `<script>` work perfectly inside the cell\n- You can build interactive tools: timers, editors, generators, games\n- The **Export PNG** button in the pixel editor shows you can use Canvas API inside a cell\n- Audio via `AudioContext` works for sound effects and notifications\n\n## Try this next\n\n- Edit the color palette generator to add a \"tetradic\" harmony (0°, 90°, 180°, 270°)\n- Change the pixel grid to 32×32 for more detail\n- Build your own HTML mini-app: a markdown previewer, a dice roller, or a CSS gradient builder"
    }
  ],
  "createdAt": "2026-04-18T21:00:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-04-18T21:00:00.000Z"
}
